GHCN-Daily data: NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information, via the
NOAA Open Data Dissemination program (s3://noaa-ghcn-pds).

Place names and coordinates: GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), cities1000,
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.

US county boundaries: U.S. Census Bureau, 2023 Cartographic Boundary Files
(cb_2023_us_county_500k).

Map outlines: us-atlas 3.0.1 (https://github.com/topojson/us-atlas), ISC
license, derived from U.S. Census Bureau cartographic boundary files.

Recent provisional observations: NOAA Regional Climate Centers, Applied Climate
Information System (ACIS), https://www.rcc-acis.org.

Forecasts: National Weather Service API (api.weather.gov). Normals: NOAA NCEI
U.S. Climate Normals 1991-2020.

Daily email tab: TweetNaCl.js 1.0.3 (https://github.com/dchest/tweetnacl-js,
public domain, Unlicense) and blakejs 1.2.1 (https://github.com/dcposch/blakejs,
CC0), loaded from jsDelivr to encrypt settings for GitHub's secrets API.
